3. NS PER REGISTRATION — the 4.5-6.4 model does NOT hold across cells
   2.78 (text t=1) .. 18.78 (c256x2048 t=8). It reproduces exactly at the cell
   it was fitted on (c1024x576 t=8: 6.49 vs 6.50) and is wrong by ~3x in both
   directions elsewhere. Uncontended (t=1) it is 2.78-3.89 ns; the high values
   are cells where TinyLock spin makes other buckets cheaper when the tracker
   goes (c256x2048: named tracker+sync symbols are 7.04 CPU ms/f but the arm
   difference is 11.36 — the profile UNDER-reports the tracker by 38% there).

